# Environment (#1625 cluster F)
#
# These three were enumerated one-by-one and so covered only what existed when they were written:
# .env.production, .env.staging and .env.e2e all slipped through, and .env.e2e holds
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY, TEST_CLERK_PASSWORD and ENCRYPTION_KEY. Wildcarded so the next one is covered
# without anyone remembering to come back here; .example templates are re-admitted because they
# are committed and hold only placeholders.
.env*
**/.env*
!.env*.example
!**/.env*.example

# Local TLS / key material.
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.key
**/*.key
*.p12
**/*.p12

